@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/Graphs/bipartite_graph_reconstruction_conjecture_2.lean
@decl S_add_map_T_eq
-- L4DEL: title: Matched cards give a cancellable equation for neighboring-type multisets
-- L4DEL: intuition: The global types on the opposite side and the local types in the matched deleted cards are equal. Decomposing both by adjacency yields the manuscript's balance equation between the two neighboring-type multisets and their type-dropped images.
-- L4DEL: step: `S_multiset` contains types of neighbors on the opposite side; `T_multiset` contains types of non-neighbors.
