@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/AlgebraicGeometry/hilbert_functions_5.lean
@decl h_seq
-- L4DEL: title: Degree counts for the divisors of one monomial
-- L4DEL: intuition: `h_seq(m,d)` (Lean: `h_seq m d`) counts the divisors of `m` having total degree `d`. Geometrically this is a slice of the exponent box below `m`; it is the principal sequence denoted `h_m(d)` in the companion proof.
-- L4DEL: step: `divisorsFinset m` provides all exponent vectors below `m`.
