@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/AlgebraicGeometry/hilbert_functions_5.lean
@decl diff
-- L4DEL: title: The first backward difference of an integer-valued sequence
-- L4DEL: intuition: At a positive index, `diff(h,d)` (Lean: `diff h d`) is `h(d)-h(d-1)`, the change from the preceding value. At index zero the definition uses `h(0)`, giving the difference operator a total boundary value on natural-number indices.
