@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/AlgebraicGeometry/hilbert_functions_5.lean
@decl H_seq
-- L4DEL: title: The decomposed degree sequence for the two-generator order ideal
-- L4DEL: intuition: `H_seq` adds the principal degree counts below `m₁` to a shifted residual degree count derived from `m₂`. The second term is zero below the threshold `m₁(x)+1`, exactly encoding the piecewise decomposition of the manuscript's equation (2).
