-- L4DEL: quote: Human-written Hilbert-functions proof companion = H(d) := hΓ (d) = hm1 (d) + 1d≥c hMred (d − c).

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/AlgebraicGeometry/hilbert_functions_5.lean
@decl diff2_H_seq_le_two
-- L4DEL: title: The decomposed two-generator sequence has second difference at most two
-- L4DEL: intuition: Because `H_seq` is the sum of two principal-type sequences and each has second difference at most `1`, its second difference is at most `2`. This confines the positive-curvature analysis to the cases `1` and `2`.
