-- L4DEL: quote: Human-written Hilbert-functions proof companion = where LA,B (k) = #{r < A : k − r < B, r ≤ k}.

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/AlgebraicGeometry/hilbert_functions_5.lean
@decl delta_L
-- L4DEL: title: The first difference of a box slice is three threshold indicators
