-- L4DEL: intuition: `H_calc(A,B,C,d)` sums the two-coordinate count `L_seq(A,B,k)` over possible partial degrees `k`, retaining only those for which the remaining exponent `d-k` fits below `C`. Lean writes these applications with spaces.
