@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/AlgebraicGeometry/hilbert_functions_5.lean
@decl delta_H_calc
-- L4DEL: title: First difference of the three-dimensional box count
-- L4DEL: intuition: At a positive degree, the change in `H_calc` is the new two-dimensional slice at `d`, minus the slice that falls out after shifting by the third side length `C`.
-- L4DEL: step: Before degree `C`, no slice falls out and the correction term is zero.
-- L4DEL: step: From degree `C` onward, `L_seq A B (d-C)` is subtracted.
-- L4DEL: step: This is the Lean form of the companion's second first-difference identity.
