@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/AlgebraicGeometry/hilbert_functions_5.lean
@decl Z_calc
-- L4DEL: title: The seven-threshold formula for discrete curvature
-- L4DEL: intuition: `Z_calc(A,B,C,d)` (Lean: `Z_calc A B C d`) combines three single-side, three pair-sum, and one triple-sum indicators. Its value is the exact second difference of a three-dimensional monomial box count.
-- L4DEL: step: The three positive indicators register whether `d` is below each side length.
-- L4DEL: step: The three negative indicators correct pairwise overlaps, and the final positive indicator restores the triple overlap.
