-- L4DEL: intuition: A state has maximally mixed reduction on the first $m$ parties.

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/QuantumOptics/35.lean
@decl OpenQuantumProblem35.hasMaximallyMixedFirstReduction_of_completion
-- L4DEL: title: The completion criterion gives a maximally mixed reduced state once the coefficient has the correct squared norm
-- L4DEL: intuition: The completion criterion gives a maximally mixed reduced state once the coefficient has the correct squared norm.

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/QuantumOptics/35.lean
@decl OpenQuantumProblem35.IsAME
-- L4DEL: title: A state $\psi$ is absolutely maximally entangled
-- L4DEL: intuition: A state $\psi$ is absolutely maximally entangled. Standard AME definitions quantify over all subsets $A \subseteq \mathrm{Fin}\, n$ with $|A| \le \lfloor n/2 \rfloor$ and require that the reduction on $A$ be maximally mixed. For pure states it is enough to check subsets of size exactly $\lfloor n/2 \rfloor$; see the references of Helwig--Cui--Riera--Latorre--Lo (2012) and Goyeneche--Alsina--Latorre--Riera--Życzkowski (2015). In this file, a subsystem of that size is encoded by first permuting the chosen parties to the front and then tracing out the remaining parties. We also require $\psi$ to be normalized explicitly.

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/QuantumOptics/35.lean
@decl OpenQuantumProblem35.IsConstantConfig
-- L4DEL: title: A configuration is constant if all coordinates agree
-- L4DEL: intuition: A configuration is constant if all coordinates agree.

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/QuantumOptics/35.lean
@decl OpenQuantumProblem35.isConstantConfig_combineFirst_one_iff
-- L4DEL: title: A configuration obtained by combining one entry with a tail is constant iff the tail is the constant completion of that entry
-- L4DEL: intuition: A configuration obtained by combining one entry with a tail is constant iff the tail is the constant completion of that entry.

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/QuantumOptics/35.lean
@decl OpenQuantumProblem35.isConstantConfig_constantConfig
-- L4DEL: title: Every constant configuration is constant
-- L4DEL: intuition: Every constant configuration is constant.

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/QuantumOptics/35.lean
@decl OpenQuantumProblem35.isConstantConfig_iff_exists_constantConfig
-- L4DEL: title: A configuration on a nonempty index type is constant iff it is equal to some constant configuration
-- L4DEL: intuition: A configuration on a nonempty index type is constant iff it is equal to some constant configuration.

@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/QuantumOptics/35.lean
@decl OpenQuantumProblem35.isConstantConfig_permute_iff
-- L4DEL: title: Permuting the parties preserves the property of being a constant configuration
-- L4DEL: intuition: Permuting the parties preserves the property of being a constant configuration.

