-- L4DEL: title: The set of multiples of a sequence $(a_i)$ is $\{na_i | n \in \mathbb{N}, i\}$
-- L4DEL: intuition: The set of multiples of a sequence $(a_i)$ is $\{na_i | n \in \mathbb{N}, i\}$.

