-- L4DEL: intuition: A227582: Expansion of $(2+3*x+2*x^2+2*x^3+3*x^4+x^5-x^6)/(1-2x+x^2-x^5+2*x^6-x^7)$. The sequence is 1-indexed in OEIS, so $a(n)$ is the $(n-1)$-th term of the 0-indexed solution.

